{"logId": "218a98db-0762-455c-b36a-0ab17fddc337", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "目标实现了，才可能实现自身的目标。只有这样才能做到“上下同欲”，才能保持团队的团结。打个形象的比喻：员工上了你这条船，你必须在他们上船后告诉他们我们的目的地是去往哪里，到达后我们能够获得什么，否则员工会感到迷茫和疑虑，对自己的未来没有方向感和安全感。", "block_bbox": [238, 228, 1017, 359], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 228.0], [1017.0, 228.0], [1017.0, 359.0], [238.0, 359.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "建立一个好的沟通制", "block_bbox": [279, 368, 509, 397], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[279.0, 368.0], [509.0, 368.0], [509.0, 397.0], [279.0, 397.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "有意见，有矛盾，出现问题相互推诿，可能出现更大的问题，这些都是沟通不够的表现。我一直都相信没有解决不了的问题。作为管理人员，打造高效能营销团队，就必须要定期与下属进行沟通，由于营销人员地处市场一线，因此他们需要关心，需要抚慰，应不断给予团队成员鼓励，挖掘其潜能，激发其斗志。要切身站在员工的立场上思考问题，如何协调好员工的工作情绪，以及建立好上下层之间的人际关系，让员工感到这个团队是温暖的。其次要充分的给予员工授权，这要求你对每一个员工的能力和业务技能有足够的认识与了解，给予团队员工适度的自行工作空间，方能调动团队的主动性与积极性。", "block_bbox": [238, 403, 1016, 638], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 403.0], [1016.0, 403.0], [1016.0, 638.0], [238.0, 638.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [74, 604, 224, 726], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[74.0, 604.0], [224.0, 604.0], [224.0, 726.0], [74.0, 726.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在我们成熟的过程中，虽然还有很多的不足，但我们坚信，只要奋斗不息，多一些用心，少一些抱怨，我们的胜利就在眼前。", "block_bbox": [238, 647, 1015, 709], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 647.0], [1015.0, 647.0], [1015.0, 709.0], [238.0, 709.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [313, 743, 950, 1217], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[313.0, 743.0], [950.0, 743.0], [950.0, 1217.0], [313.0, 1217.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "情浓电影厅", "block_bbox": [111, 1406, 295, 1449], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1406.0], [295.0, 1406.0], [295.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9454632997512817, "coordinate": [238, 228, 1017, 359], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 228.0], [1017.0, 228.0], [1017.0, 359.0], [238.0, 359.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8415415287017822, "coordinate": [279, 368, 509, 397], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[279.0, 368.0], [509.0, 368.0], [509.0, 397.0], [279.0, 397.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9607668519020081, "coordinate": [238, 403, 1016, 638], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 403.0], [1016.0, 403.0], [1016.0, 638.0], [238.0, 638.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5706828236579895, "coordinate": [74, 604, 224, 726], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[74.0, 604.0], [224.0, 604.0], [224.0, 726.0], [74.0, 726.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.896385133266449, "coordinate": [238, 647, 1015, 709], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 647.0], [1015.0, 647.0], [1015.0, 709.0], [238.0, 709.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9595531821250916, "coordinate": [313, 743, 950, 1217], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[313.0, 743.0], [950.0, 743.0], [950.0, 1217.0], [313.0, 1217.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.570125937461853, "coordinate": [111, 1406, 295, 1449], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[111.0, 1406.0], [295.0, 1406.0], [295.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "目标实现了，才可能实现自身的目标。只有这样才能做到“上下同欲”，才能保持团队的团结。打个形象的比喻：员工上了你这条船，你必须在他们上船后告诉他们我们的目的地是去往哪里，到达后我们能够获得什么，否则员工会感到迷茫和疑虑，对自己的未来没有方向感和安全感。\n\n## 建立一个好的沟通制\n\n有意见，有矛盾，出现问题相互推诿，可能出现更大的问题，这些都是沟通不够的表现。我一直都相信没有解决不了的问题。作为管理人员，打造高效能营销团队，就必须要定期与下属进行沟通，由于营销人员地处市场一线，因此他们需要关心，需要抚慰，应不断给予团队成员鼓励，挖掘其潜能，激发其斗志。要切身站在员工的立场上思考问题，如何协调好员工的工作情绪，以及建立好上下层之间的人际关系，让员工感到这个团队是温暖的。其次要充分的给予员工授权，这要求你对每一个员工的能力和业务技能有足够的认识与了解，给予团队员工适度的自行工作空间，方能调动团队的主动性与积极性。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_74_604_224_726.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n在我们成熟的过程中，虽然还有很多的不足，但我们坚信，只要奋斗不息，多一些用心，少一些抱怨，我们的胜利就在眼前。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_313_743_950_1217.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"53%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 情浓电影厅", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_74_604_224_726.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//218a98db-0762-455c-b36a-0ab17fddc337/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_74_604_224_726.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A52%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcfb3664ea161627cb0f2c58bc9f7c4d779c600beeb51d244d8fbe2d62a362849", "imgs/img_in_image_box_313_743_950_1217.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//218a98db-0762-455c-b36a-0ab17fddc337/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_313_743_950_1217.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A52%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F1a6b075986e13cf20ee4649a77494a259328afce83d9db04c99ef6005b4b484c"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//218a98db-0762-455c-b36a-0ab17fddc337/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A52%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F228533c05fc1efae0a32d99df9adb084ff985c978f0f8d1e094918c476e1ff63"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/p